    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/4e82467891b30e5146911de8531ad30b.avif?t=1749800142\" width=616 height=92 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong>Gun Shop Manager \u2013 Crime, Craft, and Custom Firepower!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gun Shop Manager, you take control of a gritty weapons shop built on a dangerous foundation a loan from the mafia. Start small with limited inventory and big debts, and rise to dominate the underground arms market.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/24337bec55b8e902a9a8d22063f708b7.poster.avif?t=1749800142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/24337bec55b8e902a9a8d22063f708b7.webm?t=1749800142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/24337bec55b8e902a9a8d22063f708b7.mp4?t=1749800142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FROM SHADY BEGINNINGS TO BLACK MARKET LEGEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with mafia and gang clients to move weapons through the city. Accept and deliver shady orders, clean and customize firearms, and fulfill high-stakes deals without attracting the attention of the police.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/91087fd86af8573316cf8116b5710633.poster.avif?t=1749800142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/91087fd86af8573316cf8116b5710633.webm?t=1749800142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/91087fd86af8573316cf8116b5710633.mp4?t=1749800142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FULLY CUSTOMIZE AND TEST EVERY WEAPON</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use scanning machines to inspect condition and authenticity, repair internal damage, and repaint or reassemble parts to customer specs. Head to the FPS-style shooting range (poligon) to test performance and make sure everything fires clean.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/802cadcdc347e1e7f0a701c06217bee6.poster.avif?t=1749800142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/802cadcdc347e1e7f0a701c06217bee6.webm?t=1749800142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/802cadcdc347e1e7f0a701c06217bee6.mp4?t=1749800142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLEAN - REPAIR - DELIVERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From polishing and fixing to packaging and delivery, every step impacts customer satisfaction and profit. Use detailed cleaning tools and part replacements to make even the oldest weapon feel brand new.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/590aff0cbd3cecc8600e4f7b55f87d83.poster.avif?t=1749800142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/590aff0cbd3cecc8600e4f7b55f87d83.webm?t=1749800142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/590aff0cbd3cecc8600e4f7b55f87d83.mp4?t=1749800142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE DARK WEB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Source rare parts, get illegal upgrades, or accept high-risk, high-reward jobs on the dark web. Just remember: the higher the risk, the closer the cops.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE, EXPAND, AND SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate and upgrade your shop, unlock specialized zones, and balance your income with rising pressure from law enforcement. Expand your reputation but watch your back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun Cleaning and Repair Systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk-Reward Gameplay with Mafia and Police Pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed Customer Interaction\u00a0and Delivery Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customer Interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon Scanning and Diagnostics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair and Testing Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic FPS Shooting Range</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark web Trading and Black Market Missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop Customization and Expansion</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <i>Gun Shop Manager</i> to your wishlist now and be one of the first to play!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1749800142\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1749800142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1749800142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/4e82467891b30e5146911de8531ad30b.avif?t=1749800142\" width=616 height=92 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong>Gun Shop Manager \u2013 Crime, Craft, and Custom Firepower!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gun Shop Manager, you take control of a gritty weapons shop built on a dangerous foundation a loan from the mafia. Start small with limited inventory and big debts, and rise to dominate the underground arms market.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/24337bec55b8e902a9a8d22063f708b7.poster.avif?t=1749800142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/24337bec55b8e902a9a8d22063f708b7.webm?t=1749800142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/24337bec55b8e902a9a8d22063f708b7.mp4?t=1749800142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FROM SHADY BEGINNINGS TO BLACK MARKET LEGEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with mafia and gang clients to move weapons through the city. Accept and deliver shady orders, clean and customize firearms, and fulfill high-stakes deals without attracting the attention of the police.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/91087fd86af8573316cf8116b5710633.poster.avif?t=1749800142\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/91087fd86af8573316cf8116b5710633.webm?t=1749800142\" type=\"video/webm; c