/3656640/extras/590aff0cbd3cecc8600e4f7b55f87d83.mp4?t=1749800142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE DARK WEB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Source rare parts, get illegal upgrades, or accept high-risk, high-reward jobs on the dark web. Just remember: the higher the risk, the closer the cops.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE, EXPAND, AND SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate and upgrade your shop, unlock specialized zones, and balance your income with rising pressure from law enforcement. Expand your reputation but watch your back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun Cleaning and Repair Systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk-Reward Gameplay with Mafia and Police Pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed Customer Interaction\u00a0and Delivery Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customer Interaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon Scanning and Diagnostics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair and Testing Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic FPS Shooting Range</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark web Trading and Black Market Missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop Customization and Expansion</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <i>Gun Shop Manager</i> to your wishlist now and be one of the first to play!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1749800142\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656640/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1749800142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs